Calls forth a ray of light from the Sun, doing [134, 180, 216, 246, 273 (TL1-5; SP 100)] Light damage to the target.

At level 3 the ray will be so intense it will also blind the target and everyone in a radius 2 around it for [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage dealt will increase with your Spellpower.
